{"unit_id":"kinyokun__dsh-session-import#card-zh","repo":"kinyokun/dsh-session-import","commit":"27ee1989fe463a53388d77a448fee4704c8436ef","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-import（DSH Web 插件）：把 DSH 官方导出的 ZIP 或 JSONL 会话日志导入为新的、可继续使用的会话。它在新会话页面提供“导入对话”入口，并通过宿主 API 解析日志、迁移官方格式、写入会话存储并关联目标工作区。主要功能包括预览日志及附件、恢复子会话关系、导入图片和文件附件、保留会话状态，以及在导入后尝试打开会话。适合需要迁移或恢复 DSH 会话历史的用户；需要 DSH Web 和兼容的 JSONL 存储后端，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:558-590","host.js:63-70","importer.js:78-120"]}
{"unit_id":"kinyokun__dsh-session-import#card-en","repo":"kinyokun/dsh-session-import","commit":"27ee1989fe463a53388d77a448fee4704c8436ef","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-import is a DSH Web plugin for importing ZIP or JSONL session logs as new sessions. It provides a browser dialog, previews session data, restores child sessions and attachments, and connects imported history to a chosen workspace. Requires compatible DSH Web JSONL storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:558-590","host.js:63-70","importer.js:78-120"]}
